  "object_result": "Original fixed K/rule2 and S/rule0 are instantiated through the accepted original ObjectTreeTemplate / original axiom-table factory, with kernel-proved exact memberships. apply_axiom constructs the axiom code, certificate, full grammar queries, exact logical proof and an actual MP parent from a genuine proof of its antecedent. weaken_proof maps a real proof of B to a proof of the actual A->B code. distribute maps proofs of A->(B->C) and A->B to a proof of the actual A->C code, generating the intermediate implication and both actual MP parents. compose consumes actual typed A/B/C, actual original implication constructors I=A->B, J=B->C and K=A->C, and real proofs of I and J; it generates all additional implication/axiom/certificate/query/proof codes and three original MP parents to prove K. Empty target bound scope is retained, while the free scope, formulas and all proof codes range over all internal omega including nonstandard. Original Node/header and Root at empty free scope are retained, both complete original ZF/U tests are supported, and no new object syntax/checker/kernel/background axiom is introduced. This is NATIVE literal implication proof composition needed for the fixed logical steps of the source forcing proof. It is NOT the ForcingLogicalCode.binary 2 normalized forcing-implication preservation bridge; full regularity/monotonicity, open closure transport, uniform coded semantic/axiom/proof correctness, InternalConsistency.reduction and final Con remain unproved.",
