  ],
  "endpoint_type": "FirstOrder.Derives nativeZF [] (Translation.sentence (...)) in the unchanged YesMetaZFC kernel",
  "actual_main_object_contract": {
    "composition": "Omega(w) -> empty(z) -> FormulaCode(w,A,z,b) -> FormulaCode(w,B,z,b) -> FormulaCode(w,C,z,b) -> Constructor(2,7,[A,B],I) -> Constructor(2,7,[B,C],J) -> Constructor(2,7,[A,C],K) -> Proved(I) -> Proved(J) -> Proved(K). Proved is the unchanged actual existential original Node/header, with original Root whenever free scope is empty. Both unchanged complete ZF/U tests are supported.",
    "actual_operations": "Original K/rule2 yields B -> (A -> B) and original S/rule0 yields (A -> (B -> C)) -> ((A -> B) -> (A -> C)). Their external table memberships are kernel-proved. Every axiom code, certificate, grammar query row, actual logical proof and intermediate implication is constructed inside object existentials. Three original actual MP nodes produce the conclusion proof; neither an axiom proof nor an intermediate parent proof is supplied. The conclusion code K is specified by its actual original A/C constructor, not a proof oracle.",
